            "created_at": "2026-09-25T14:01:39.064Z",
            "cooked": "<p><img src=\"https://emoji.discourse-cdn.com/twemoji/rocket.png?v=15\" title=\":rocket:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":rocket:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Available for Hire — n8n Automation Specialist (Self-Hosted, Production-Grade)</p>\n<p>LinkedIn: <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/komal-zawar-a6b455345/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://www.linkedin.com/in/komal-zawar-a6b455345/</a></p>\n<p>Hi n8n community! I’m Komal — a Digital Media &amp; Automation Executive currently running self-hosted n8n (Hetzner) in production for a well-known media organization in Pakistan, handling daily content pipelines across YouTube, Facebook, Instagram, and TikTok.</p>\n<p>What I build:<br>\n<img src=\"https://emoji.discourse-cdn.com/twemoji/small_blue_diamond.png?v=15\" title=\":small_blue_diamond:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":small_blue_diamond:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Content scheduling &amp; publishing automation (yt-dlp, ffmpeg, Google Drive, Meta APIs)<br>\n<img src=\"https://emoji.discourse-cdn.com/twemoji/small_blue_diamond.png?v=15\" title=\":small_blue_diamond:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":small_blue_diamond:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> AI Agent workflows using Claude API, OpenAI (GPT-4o + Whisper) for SEO/GEO-optimized content generation<br>\n<img src=\"https://emoji.discourse-cdn.com/twemoji/small_blue_diamond.png?v=15\" title=\":small_blue_diamond:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":small_blue_diamond:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Multi-step approval pipelines (Gmail-based human-in-the-loop review)<br>\n<img src=\"https://emoji.discourse-cdn.com/twemoji/small_blue_diamond.png?v=15\" title=\":small_blue_diamond:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":small_blue_diamond:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Video/clip automation — chapter extraction, precision cutting with Whisper timestamp alignment<br>\n<img src=\"https://emoji.discourse-cdn.com/twemoji/small_blue_diamond.png?v=15\" title=\":small_blue_diamond:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":small_blue_diamond:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Google Sheets/Drive integrations for content tracking and QC</p>\n<p>I’m self-taught in AI/ML and automation, with a Certificate in Artificial Intelligence (IQA, USA, via Arfa Karim Technology Incubator). I also hold certifications in Emotional Intelligence practice, which shapes how I design human-approval steps into automation — practical, not just technically clever.</p>\n<p>Open to:<br>\n<img src=\"https://emoji.discourse-cdn.com/twemoji/white_check_mark.png?v=15\" title=\":white_check_mark:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":white_check_mark:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Building new n8n workflows from scratch<br>\n<img src=\"https://emoji.discourse-cdn.com/twemoji/white_check_mark.png?v=15\" title=\":white_check_mark:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":white_check_mark:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Debugging/optimizing existing workflows<br>\n<img src=\"https://emoji.discourse-cdn.com/twemoji/white_check_mark.png?v=15\" title=\":white_check_mark:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":white_check_mark:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> AI agent + automation consulting (content, social media, marketing ops)</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://emoji.discourse-cdn.com/twemoji/envelope_with_arrow.png?v=15\" title=\":envelope_with_arrow:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":envelope_with_arrow:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> DM me here or connect on LinkedIn (link above)</p>\n<p>Happy to share workflow screenshots/architecture on request!</p>",
